INFRA_FILES["infra/README.md"] = """# Infrastructure stack

Generated by `labctl init` from documents 01–11.

All management listeners bind to `127.0.0.1`. Do not publish these ports.
Do not put API keys in these files — use `*.env` (gitignored) copied from
`*.env.example`.

| Path | Plane | Document |
|---|---|---|
| `lima/` | Execution | 02, 03 |
| `gateway/` | Model | 01, 03, 05 |
| `observability/` | AI observability | 06 |
| `mcp/` | Capability | 03, 04 |
| `aegis/` | Policy | 04 |
| `numbat/` | Agent visibility | 04, 05 |
| `instrumentation/` | Experiment observability | 06, 07 |
| `harness-router.yaml` | Control | 01, 05 |
| `../policies/` | Security | 04 |

Apply with:

```bash
./scripts/bin/labctl stack up --stack observability
./scripts/bin/labctl stack up --stack gateway
```

Both require a container runtime and `--apply`. Dry-run is the default for
compose changes that start processes.
"""

